01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le11ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I wish I hadn't left my phone at work. Why are you brooding Peter? You've been so reticent recently. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I hadn't ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Go on!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: If I hadn't gone to that party at your restaurant, I wouldn't have met Amy. That's all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you hadn't come that night you couldn't have rescued me from that horribly hostile customer who nearly beat up my sous chef! Thank heavens you were there. You remember?", "id": 1}, {"time": "29000", "image": "engenn9le11ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I remember that hostility! If I hadn't spilled wine on his shoe, he wouldn't have been distracted at the right moment.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: ... He wouldn't have slipped and broken his ankle which rendered him helpless for the rest of the night. He also would have beaten up Pascal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  If none of that had happened, then the ambulance wouldn't have come and Amy wouldn't have entered my life. I wish she had not been on her shift that night!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Wait a sec! I know she left on a trip to Africa, but did you guys end things?", "id": 2}, {"time": "60000", "image": "engenn9le11ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She's gone. That says it all, doesn't it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How did you leave things?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She gave me some lame apology. If she had really cared for me, she shouldn't have done that.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe she was being sincere, Peter! You really have a wall up. I wish you would  learn to relax. Why are you so closed?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I wish I could be more open.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}